{"id":"abstand","lemma":"Abstand","pos":"noun","rank":2420,"glosses":["distance, interspace, spacing, interval, gap"],"ipa":"/ˈapʃtant/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/De-Abstand.ogg/De-Abstand.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Abstandes","plural":"Abstände"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie möchte ihn auf Abstand halten.","en":"She wants to keep him at a distance.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"on"},null,{"g":"to hold"}]},{"text":"Ich kann Abstände nicht schätzen.","en":"I can't judge distance.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to estimate"}]},{"text":"Das ist der mit Abstand beste Weg.","en":"This is by far the best way.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"away"}]},{"text":"Er hat von der Politik Abstand genommen.","en":"He distanced himself from politics.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"politics"},null,{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"}]},{"text":"Lasst mehr Abstand zwischen den Zeilen.","en":"Leave more space between the lines.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"between"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"in a text or table","l":"Zeile"}]}]}